%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMitoko? Hey, Mitoko!\nAre you okay over there? Did something happen?!\d%K%P
「美都子？\n等等美都子，没事吧？\n到底怎么了！？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMitoko! Open the door! I heard some really loud noises!\nAre you hurt?!\d%K%P
「美都子、开门、开门啊！\n这么大的声音，没事吧？　没有受伤吧！？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dWhat on earth is going on here?\d%K%P
「这到底是怎么回事啊…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, Mr. Retired... um...\d%K%P
「啊，老爷子…这是」%K%P
After hearing Mitoko's door open, I hurried to her room to\napologize for missing my dinner. But when I got there...%K%P
因为从美都子的房间传来了开门的声音，\n我想去找她再一次为了晚饭取消的事道歉，\n现在正站在她的房间门前。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWhat was that sound? It sounded like a drunk, retired\nbaseball player venting his frustration in the dining\nroom!\d%K%P
「真是厉害的声音啊。\n简直就像是，曾经是棒球选手的父亲喝得酩酊大醉，\n在餐桌上大发雷霆啊…」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dYou don't get it, Hachi! You don't get it at all! That\nscene only ever pops up in the entire work once! It's a\nfalse image precipitated by later historians!\d%K%P
「你说这个谁懂啊八。\n那种描写在作品中实际上也只出现过一次。\n那都是后世的历史学家擅自强加的印象」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOne thing I do know is that this discussion can wait.\d%K%P
「我只知道现在不是什么该进行狂热讨论的时候」\n※译注：出自ＴＶ动画版的《巨人之星》。%K%P
Following three loud sounds in quick succession, the room\nfell completely silent.%K%P
从里面先是连续三次响起高亢的破坏音，\n接下来就回到了寂静。%K%P
No matter how you sliced it, there was nothing ordinary\nabout that.%K%P
怎么想，这都不是什么普通的状况。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWh-What if a closet fell on her or something?!\d%K%P
「难、难道说…被倒下的衣柜给压住了！？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dI do believe we disposed of every tall closet in the\nhouse, though. The Young Mistress could never reach their\ntop drawers, so she hated them.\d%K%P
「比较高的衣柜应该都被处理掉了啊。\n…小房东拉不开上面的抽屉」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dActually, it sounded more like something being smashed.\nMaybe she dropped a plate or something?\d%K%P
「说回来刚才是餐具的声音吧。\n盘子掉下来了吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dM-Maybe... she stubbed her toe against the table,\nand...!\d%K%P
「难、难道说…\n被小桌给压到小指了吗…！？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dWell, that would definitely be a pain for the person\ninvolved, but is it really something to freak out about?\d%K%P
「那对她本人来说的确是一件大惨事，\n但你至于脸色苍白到这个地步吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMitoko! Please!\nAnswer us! Say something if you can hear us!\d%K%P
「美都子拜托了！\n回答我…回答我吧！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dShuuuut upppp!!!\d%K%P
「吵死～～～～了！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dOh.\d%K%P
「啊呀」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dSo...\d%K%P
「这又是」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dWhat'd you do now?\d%K%P
「怎么」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTh-Thank goodness... She's still conscious... Thank God\nfor that...\d%K%P
「太、太好了…\n意识还在，真是太好了」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...You're handling this awfully well, Young Master.\d%K%P
「…小少爷也不沮丧了呢」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dDude's got plenty of experience with this kinda thing,\nafter all.\d%K%P
「到底积累了多少处理这类事件的经验了啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
The phone interrupted us just as the tense atmosphere in\nthe corridor relaxed a little.%K%P
这种一下子缓和下来的气氛\n开始在走廊上的四个人之间流淌的时候，电话的声音响了起来。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dHello. This is the Terrace House Hinosaka. H-Huh? Mrs.\nTakeda? What happened? Did someone forget something?\d%K%P
「你好，这里是Terrace House阳之坂…\n呃，啊咧～？竹田婆婆？\n怎么了？有谁忘东西了？」%K%P
It was almost like a devilish prank that wouldn't let us\nrelax, not even for a second.%K%P
那是说什么也不让只剩下一个小时的今天回归往日的平静的、\n不知哪位神仙开的玩笑…%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dHuh? What did you just say?\d%K%P
「哈啊？\n你说啥？」%K%P
Or was it...%K%P
还是说…%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dMs. #2... Kaya has collapsed?\d%K%P
「二号妹…夏夜妹子倒下了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶………？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dNm...\d%K%P
「嗯…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dNm... mhm...?\d%K%P
「嗯、嗯嗯…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dKaya. Kaya?\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐、夏夜小姐？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dH-Huh...?\d%K%P
「啊、咦…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThank goodness... I thought you'd never wake up.\d%K%P
「太好了…终于醒过来了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWhere... are we...?\d%K%P
「这里、是哪…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWe're at the park.\nOur usual spot at West Hagimori, to be more specific.\d%K%P
「公园啊。老地方那个西萩守」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWhy...?\d%K%P
「发生了什么…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDo you remember what happened? You fainted.\d%K%P
「还记得吗？\n夏夜小姐，就在刚才，失去了意识」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Oh.\d%K%P
「………啊～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dPhew, so you do remember...\d%K%P
「太好了，还记得…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOh, so you did it so hard I actually blacked out...\d%K%P
「原来是让我高潮到失去意识的程度了啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Or not.\d%K%P
「…看来不记得了呢」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHuh?\d%K%P
「啊咧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou were at the bathhouse -- Take no Yu.\nYou ended up spending too much time in the hot water.\d%K%P
「是澡堂啊。『竹之汤』。\n你在那里泡晕了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThe bathhouse...?\d%K%P
「澡堂…？」%K%P
The owner of Take no Yu found Kaya flushed red and\nunconscious in one of their hotter pools as she came to\ninspect the women's bath before closing up.%K%P
似乎是跟平时一样巡视女澡堂的『竹之汤』的女老板，\n发现了澡盆中浑身通红、失去了意识的夏夜小姐。%K%P
Apparently, the temperature of the water was forty-five\ndegrees. She seemed to have forgotten to turn off the hot\nwater tap.%K%P
顺带一提那个时候洗澡水的温度是４５度。\n洗澡水的龙头是关闭的状态。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShe said you were in there for two hours.\nWhat on earth were you thinking?\d%K%P
「泡了接近两个小时呢？\n为什么那么乱来啊？」%K%P
I met Kaya at West Hagimori Park around six.%K%P
在这座西萩守公园和夏夜小姐碰头的时间是６点。%K%P
After doing everything she asked of me to satiate her\ncarnal appetite, we went our separate ways around nine.%K%P
回应着比起昨天晚上更积极地渴求着我的夏夜小姐，\n做了各种各样的事之后，各自踏上归途应该是在９点。%K%P
And now... it was almost midnight.%K%P
而现在…日期马上就要改变了。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Ah.\d%K%P
「………啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDo you remember no--\d%K%P
「这次该想起来…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'm lying on your lap...\d%K%P
「理君的膝枕啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...This might take a while.\d%K%P
「…看起来还没想起来呢」%K%P
By the time I arrived, the owner of the bathhouse had\nalready dressed up the unconscious Kaya. So instead of\ntaking her straight home, I figured it'd be best to let\nher cool down somewhere outside.%K%P
女老板给在澡盆里失去知觉的夏夜小姐穿上衣服，\n之后，在把她带回去之前，让夏夜小姐在这里乘一下凉。%K%P
...Naturally, I wasn't planning a repeat of what we did\nthree hours ago.%K%P
…跟三个小时前，意图并不一样。%K%P
In any case, I made her lie down on one of the benches,\nand placed her head on my knees. It took about thirty\nminutes for her to finally wake up.%K%P
总之先让夏夜小姐躺在长椅上，\n让她的头枕在我的膝盖上，盯着她的睡脸看了３０分钟。%K%P
I spent that time staring at her defenseless sleeping face\n-- a soothing sight that would certainly help a man relax\nafter a tough night.%K%P
她稍微缓和了沉重的心情，\n带着毫无防备的表情沉沉地睡着。%K%P
...In a sense, though, one could say she was even more\n\ddefenseless\d while awake.%K%P
…不，对于这个人来说，平时的时候更没有防备。%K%P
Anyway, the point was... that it felt nice to see her like\nthis once in a while.%K%P
但是，和一直以来她刻意表现出的无防备不一样，\n这种非常自然的无防备也并不坏。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCan you walk?\nWe can rest for a while longer if you're still not feeling\nwell.\d%K%P
「能站起来吗？\n如果很累的话，再休息一会儿也没事」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dNm?\d%K%P
「嗯～？」%K%P
She gave me a vague answer as she rubbed her cheek against\nmy thigh, then reached out to squeeze my knees.%K%P
一边有气无力地回答着我，\n一边用脸颊蹭着我的大腿，\n把手伸向我的膝盖，柔和地触碰着我。%K%P
She really did enjoy physical contact of all kinds.%K%P
…真的，很喜欢肌肤相亲啊这个人。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnyway, I'm glad nothing serious happened.\d%K%P
「但是真是太好了。没什么大问题」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWhy? Were you worried about me?\d%K%P
「怎么了？很担心我吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMy blood practically froze in my veins when I heard that\nyou collapsed.\d%K%P
「一开始听到你倒下的时候全身都僵住了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Haha.\d%K%P
「…呵呵」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt wasn't that funny to me.\d%K%P
「这可不是该高兴的地方啊」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou were worried about me... About me and no one else...\nAhaha, haha... haha...\d%K%P
「理君很担心我啊。理君啊。\n啊哈哈、哈哈…………哈？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHm? Is something wrong?\nDoes your head still hurt?\d%K%P
「？怎么了？\n难道说，头还在痛吗？」%K%P
Kaya, happily chuckling to herself until just a second\nago, suddenly pressed her palm against her forehead and\nfroze up.%K%P
很开心地噗嗤噗嗤窃笑着的夏夜小姐，\n不知为何突然用手捂住了额头，全身变得僵硬起来。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAh, ah, ah...\d%K%P
「啊、啊、啊………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dKaya?\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐？」%K%P
Her body began to tremble, like she was frozen to the\nbone.%K%P
不止如此，\n这次她僵硬的身体像是快要露出寒气一样，\n开始瑟瑟发抖起来。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWh-What about Ms. Landlord? Where is she?\d%K%P
「房、房东小姐…那个女孩…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWh-What do I do... What do I do... Oh no, I did something\nterrible... Osamu... what should I do?! I really fucked\nup!\d%K%P
「怎、怎么办…怎么办啊。\n我、我、做了不能弥补的事…\n怎么办啊理君，我干出来了啊！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
Everything clicked.%K%P
那个时候的我，终于渐渐明白了…%K%P
I could no longer cheat my way through this.%K%P
我作为一个懦夫的时间，终于来到了终点。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'm sorry.\d%K%P
「非常抱歉」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's not your fault.\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐没有错」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'm sorry.\d%K%P
「非常抱歉」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dReally, it's my own fault.\d%K%P
「都是我的问题」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'm sorry.\d%K%P
「非常抱歉」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCome on, just calm down for a second.\d%K%P
「好了，冷静下来」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'm sorry.\d%K%P
「非常抱歉」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dKaya!\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...!\d%K%P
「…」%K%P
Kaya clutched the hem of my shirt and buried her face in\nmy lap while gritting her teeth in frustration. She kept\nrepeating that barrage of apologies, believing that this\nwas all her fault.%K%P
拼命地拽着我的衣摆、把脸埋在我的膝盖上，\n紧紧咬住的牙齿之间漏出的叹息、\n只是在不停地对相信自己有罪的事实进行着道歉。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'm... such a filthy liar.\d%K%P
「我，是个大骗子」%K%P
Here she was, a somewhat eccentric but endlessly forgiving\ngirl who kept shamelessly approaching me with her silly\nyet unapologetic schemes...%K%P
这个一直是个十分超然、包容力满满、\n把我玩弄于鼓掌之间的奇怪之人。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI promised not to be a burden for you. That I was okay\nwith being number two... But that was all complete and\nutter nonsense.\d%K%P
「不会成为理君的负担也好、\n就算当第二位的女友也没问题也好，都只是我的信口开河而已」%K%P
But as she lay there on my lap in the fetal position, Kaya\nlooked almost like a small child -- lost, confused, and\nscared.%K%P
现在，只是像是不知该如何是好的孩子一样，\n将身体蜷缩得小小的，因为由后悔带来的不安而颤抖着。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIt never would've worked out. It was so hard to endure...\nI almost went insane. I grew insanely jealous of her.\d%K%P
「不可能那样的吧。\n好痛苦…好难受啊。\n那个姑娘…我好羡慕啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry.\d%K%P
「非常抱歉」%K%P
I snatched the words right out of her mouth. Or rather, I\nwas meant to be the one to utter them in the first place.%K%P
我夺走了夏夜小姐的话语。\n不，这本来就只是应该由我来说的话语而已。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI thought I could handle it. You'd be gentle with her,\nand you'd love me where she couldn't see. I thought it'd\nbe the perfect scenario for all three of us.\d%K%P
「我本以为自己已经想开了。\n她得到理君的温柔。我得到理君的疼爱。\n就这样十分从容、圆满地解决」%K%P
I stroked Kaya's wet hair as she continued to vent all her\nregrets.%K%P
我轻轻地抚摸着不停地说着后悔的话语，\n但仍然没有离开我身边的她的润湿的头发。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBut... it made me happy when you were kind to me. I\nrealized I wanted more and more... and in the end, I\nwanted all of you.\d%K%P
「但是…得到你这样温柔的对待，我也很开心。\n这个也想要，那个也想要，到头来果然还是全部都想要」%K%P
The more she talked, the more spirited her demeanor\nbecame. I decided not to interrupt.%K%P
就这样，我明白了自己的轻抚让夏夜小姐蜷缩的身子渐渐展开，于是手也停不下来了。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI don't want to be number two... Why can't anyone hate\nyou...? Why do women keep falling for you one after\nanother...?\d%K%P
「第二位什么的不要啊…\n不管是谁也好，对理君，都多讨厌一点啊。\n不要再、更喜欢他了啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhy... would you get that impression? I'm a total failure\nof a man, let alone a human being...\d%K%P
「为什么…会这么想呢？\n对于像这样的，别说是作为男人，就算是作为人也是废柴的我」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou can go ask Ms. Landlord about it. If I tried to tell\nyou, I wouldn't shut up 'til sunrise.\d%K%P
「这种问题，去问一下房东小姐不就好了。\n让我说的话会说得很长」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, the reason I have no confidence is because no one\never gives me a straight answer when I ask about this.\d%K%P
「就因为这样，谁也不跟我说，\n现在我对自己完全没有自信啊」%K%P
That was why I couldn't predict Kaya's sudden change of\nheart. Or why I didn't realize how hurt Toko would be.%K%P
所以，夏夜小姐心情的变化也好、\n美都子受伤的理由也好，\n我完全，没有考虑到。%K%P
I went through life unknowingly hurting those around me,\nconfirming my status as a terrible human being on a daily\nbasis.%K%P
这样的话我又一次，伤害了自己喜欢的人们，\n作为最差劲的人被钉在了耻辱柱上。%K%P
How was I supposed to believe that someone could obsess\nover me to the extent of endangering their own livelihood?%K%P
毕竟，在目击了这样的场景之前，\n我根本不相信，拘泥于这样的我、到最后被压垮的人，真的有存在。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'm disgusting...\d%K%P
「真丑陋啊，我…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou're beautiful, Kaya.\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐很美丽哦」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBut my heart is ugly.\d%K%P
「心灵很丑陋」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's not true. I would have never been able to return\nto my normal life and work as hard as I do right now if\nyou hadn't come for me that night.\d%K%P
「才不是这样的。\n我之所以能像现在这样，即使不断受挫还在不停努力，\n都是因为夏夜小姐在那个时候捡起了我」%K%P
Kaya provided me with a place to escape after I lost both\nmy job and paycheck for the second time in a row. If she\nhadn't shown up, I would have probably drowned myself in\nalcohol instead.%K%P
夏夜小姐把她自己这个逃避之所，\n奉献给了失去了工作和最初的工资，也没法回到公寓，\n只能无可救药地在酒中逃避着的我。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI made use of your weakness. I cornered and forced you to\nmake love to me, effectively blocking your path of\nescape.\d%K%P
「那只是因为你当时很虚弱，钻你的空子而已啊。\n把理君逼到了无路可逃的处境，\n逼着你抱住了我」%K%P
Being in more or less the same position as Ms. Honoka as\nfar I was concerned, but with different emotions stirring\nher heart, Kaya was no doubt the woman I needed half a\nyear ago.%K%P
和穗香小姐站在同样的立场、\n却和穗香小姐怀着不一样的感情抱向我的、\n追求着『半年前的我』的女性。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI wanted to make love to you as well, Kaya.\nI was happy you gave me the chance.\d%K%P
「我本来，也是想抱夏夜小姐的啊。\n你诱惑我的时候，我很开心」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou're lying through your teeth... But they're such sweet\nlittle lies, I can't help but want to believe them...\d%K%P
「净说假话…\n但是，这个假话却让我心情好得不得了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI truly am grateful for everything you've done for me. I\nknow it must have been tough to put up with all my needs\nand conditions.\d%K%P
「一直以来，实在是非常感谢。\n一直包容着我过分的任性」%K%P
I'd use Kaya's feelings as a means to soothe my own broken\nheart, then chuck her back into the closet whenever I\ndidn't need her.%K%P
抓住夏夜小姐“自称”喜欢上我的弱点，\n我不由分说地，把她关进了黑暗的壁橱。%K%P
Despite wanting her myself, I would constantly make her\ntake the lead. I felt comfortable pushing all the\nresponsibility on her so I could have my excuse.%K%P
明明我自己也是想这么做的，\n却一直让她这么说，一直不停地积累着免罪符。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnyway, let's go home.\d%K%P
「好了，回去吧」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI... can't go back there anymore.\d%K%P
「已经、回不去了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dKaya...\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐…」%K%P
And that ended up pushing her to the limit. She thrust the\nblade she'd been holding against her own chest with so\nmuch strength that it went straight through her and\nplunged into the nearby Mitoko.%K%P
正因如此，夏夜小姐的情绪最终超过了极限，\n在挥向自己的刀刃狠狠地贯穿了自己的身体后，\n余势还波及到了在自己身旁的美都子。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI mean... I broke the one rule you wanted to protect at\nall costs.\d%K%P
「因为我，把理君拼命守护的、\n最为重要的原则给粉碎了」%K%P
It pierced the heart of the one girl I dreaded to hurt the\nmost.%K%P
最为害怕我受到伤害，\n最后却伤害了我最重要的被监护人。%K%P
And it was all my fault.%K%P
都是我的错。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's okay... Mitoko is a gentle girl. I've lost count of\nhow many times she's forgiven me.\d%K%P
「没关系的…\n美都子，是一个温柔的女孩子。\n就算是我这样的人，她也原谅了我许多次」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou clearly mean a lot to her. In her eyes, I'm no more\nthan a parasite following you around as I inject you with\nmy venom.\d%K%P
「因为理君，是她重要的人嘛。\n而我对她来说，岂止仅仅是纠缠着那个重要的人而已，已经是一个散发着毒液的害虫了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDo you really believe that? Can you honestly claim that\nafter having spent the last few months with her?\d%K%P
「你真的，是这么想的吗？\n和美都子接触了这么长时间，仍然是真心这么认为吗？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf you do, then even I might get angry. I won't forgive\nanyone who'd badmouth Mitoko.\d%K%P
「如果你真的是这么想的话，就算是我，偶尔也是会生气的。\n说美都子的坏话，我可不能原谅」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOsamu...\d%K%P
「理君…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dLet me talk to her. It might take some time, but she'll\nunderstand.\d%K%P
「所以说，我来跟美都子说吧。\n虽然可能会花一点时间，但是我会让她好好地明白的」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI wouldn't recommend it.\nWhat I said to her was way more cruel than you might\nthink.\d%K%P
「还是别去比较好吧？\n因为我，的确说的非常过分啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI believe in her.\d%K%P
「因为我相信着美都子啊」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...That's exactly what makes this hard for me.\d%K%P
「…都说了你这么说很让人难受啊」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMitoko. Mitoko, can you hear me?\d%K%P
「美都子、\n美都子？」%K%P
Kaya was still quite out of it, even after we returned to\nthe boarding house.%K%P
夏夜小姐回公寓的时候，\n仍然有些摇摇晃晃的。%K%P
Nonetheless, she had recovered to the point where she\ncould force a smile in front of all the people that stayed\nup worrying about her.%K%P
但是，从她还能对担心她的大家强作笑脸这一点看，\n她应该已经可以看得清周围的东西了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI wonder if she's already asleep...\d%K%P
「已经…睡了吗？」%K%P
Her recent emotional trauma seemed to have made Kaya\nforget our current policy while at the boarding house --\nshe clung to my hand until we reached her room.%K%P
但是，因为刚刚完全释放了自己的感情的原因，\n她完全忘记了平时摆在大家面前的姿态，\n紧紧地握着我的手不松开。%K%P
Everyone understood the situation right away, and after\nquickly confirming that she was okay, returned to Mr.\nRetired's room.%K%P
大家看到这个样子的她，\n基本也察觉到了事情的全貌，都默默地回到了老爷子的房间。%K%P
Although, the main thing that convinced them of the\nvalidity of our relationship was not Kaya's behavior, but\nmine... After all, my past self would've no doubt tried to\nshake her hand off in a panic.%K%P
但是，大家之所以确信了我们两人的关系，\n似乎并不是因为夏夜小姐那露骨的行为，\n而是因为没有甩开她的手的我的态度。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI don't want to wake you in case you're asleep, so I'll\ntalk in a low voice. But if you happen to be awake, it'd\nmake me very happy if you listened.\d%K%P
「睡的话可不行啊，我会小声地跟你说的。\n要是醒着的话，希望能听我说一下」%K%P
And so... only one more person remained who needed to know\nthe truth.%K%P
所以说，剩下的只有一人。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm... it seems like Kaya told you something about us.\d%K%P
「那个…夏夜小姐，\n好像说了一些关于我的事…」%K%P
The one person I wanted to keep from learning about my\nrelationship with Kaya.%K%P
最不想知道\n我们两人之间关系的人。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI don't know exactly what she told you, but... listen,\nMitoko...\d%K%P
「不，实际上呢，夏夜小姐到底说了什么，\n我也没有仔细问。\n但是啊，美都子…」%K%P
The one person that should have been told first.%K%P
但是，也是理应第一个被通知到\n我们之间关系的人。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHer words, no matter how bad they might have sounded...\d%K%P
「她说的事，\n就算显得有多么地不诚实…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...are all true.\d%K%P
「那全部，都是真的」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
The other side of the door remained dead silent.%K%P
门的那边，\n仍然鸦雀无声。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf what you heard made you lose faith in me, then...\d%K%P
「对于美都子来说，\n如果觉得从她那里听到的我的样子，值得轻蔑的话…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Well, that's just the kind of person I am.\d%K%P
「我啊，就是那样的男人」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
Was she sleeping? Too angry to speak? Or... was she\nperhaps wrestling with an entirely different emotion?%K%P
是在犯困呢，还是在生气呢。\n还是说…还有其它的感情留存在心里呢。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI had her keep silent about it simply because I didn't\nwant you to hate me. And I do realize how flimsy and\ncowardly of a reason that is.\d%K%P
「之所以堵上了她的嘴…\n只是出于『不想被美都子讨厌』，\n这种懦弱的、卑怯的、最差劲的动机」%K%P
Still no response.%K%P
门那边依旧静寂，什么也没有传达过来。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo at the very least, I want you to understand one thing\n-- that none of this was Kaya's fault. If there's someone\nto blame here, it's me.\d%K%P
「所以说，夏夜小姐什么错也没有。\n错的全部都是我，希望你能明白」%K%P
Mitoko's silence made it difficult to tell whether or not\nmy one-sided speech was getting us anywhere.%K%P
所以，我这单方向的沟通…\n不知不觉间，已经不知道如何应对对面的沉默了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...That's all I had to say.\nWell then, goodnight.\d%K%P
「…今天要说的，只有这些了。\n那么，晚安了」%K%P
Just a few hours ago, we were cheerfully strolling through\nthe shopping district together...%K%P
仅仅数小时之前，\n我们还一起在商店街上东奔西跑。%K%P
...telling shop owners how their neighbors were selling\nthe same product at a cheaper price, or how they had\nincreased the volumes of their packages.%K%P
说着『那边要便宜２０日元喔？』之类的，\n『不过对面的铺子会把零头抹掉啊～』之类的话。%K%P
It was quite amusing to observe how prices would drop\nevery time Mitoko began to pout -- we snickered together\nas we looked at our final bill.%K%P
美都子在每一次闹过别扭之后，都会为了砍下蔬菜和肉类的价格而开心，\n在结算之后，也会和我一起噗嗤噗嗤地偷笑。%K%P
Were we done? Was that the last time we'd ever do that?%K%P
那已经是…\n无法重回的过去了吗？%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
Just as I was about to shift my gaze away from Mitoko's\ndoor and turn the corner...%K%P
走向走廊的转角，\n美都子的房间马上就要从我的视野中消失的时候…%K%P
It suddenly let out its characteristically unnerving creak\n-- the one I'd been so used to hearing every day.%K%P
关不严的屋门，\n发出了高亢的、稍微有一点点不快的，\n但也是我每天听习惯了的声音。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
The moment I entered the room...%K%P
进入房间的瞬间…%K%P
I was forced to realize how much my actions had hurt not\nonly Kaya, but Mitoko as well...%K%P
我这才痛感，自己做出来的事，\n不管是对夏夜小姐，还是对美都子来说，\n到底沉重到了什么地步。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dFirst of all... let's get everything cleaned up. Can I\nturn on the lights?\d%K%P
