「噢，小熊，怎么样了？里面的情况」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dDead silent.\nI was expecting to hear the sounds of a struggle, but\nnope.\d%K%P
「很是安静呢。\n也没有听到那种要把脸打肿的声音」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dCut it out, you two. Just for once, let's refrain from\nmaking jokes about this situation.\d%K%P
「两个人都要好好的啊。\n只有这次，可不要开玩笑哦？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dI wonder how it'll go...\d%K%P
「到底，会怎么样呢…」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dHe got forced out just for living in her room for a few\ndays. I can't see them being able to stay together in this\nplace.\d%K%P
「在外面的时候他俩只是住在一起，失业的就被赶出去了吧？\n这次他俩在公寓里面搞上了，这已经没办法了吧」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dLast time, they were in a grey area, but now... it might\nhave seriously infringed on the ethical laws of the\nTerrace House Hinosaka.\d%K%P
「上回可能处在地下状态的吧，\n但是这次，要受到Terrace House伦理机构的强硬抵触了啊」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dEveryone living here is over eighteen, though.\d%K%P
「所有的住户都在１８岁以上哦？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI thought we agreed to cut out the jokes, Mr. Retired.\d%K%P
「不是说了不要再开玩笑了吗，老爷子…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dThat said... the li'l landlord had already more or less\nfigured out what was going on between those two way\nearlier.\d%K%P
