%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dYep, it's definitely his fault.\d%K%P
「是失业者的错呢」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dIt's the Young Master's fault, no matter how you look at\nit. Even if we consider that him being decisive is about\nas likely as Kuma doing a day's worth of honest work.\d%K%P
「是小少爷的错啊。\n…不过当机立断的小少爷，\n可是比认真工作的熊先生更加难以想象呢」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dWhen you put it like that, it kinda makes me feel like\nthis whole thing was inevitable.\d%K%P
「这么考虑的话，\n这个结论大概可以说是无法避免的命运啊…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dYou're not even going to try to refute that comment?!\d%K%P
「承认了吗？不反驳吗？你这超主动无业人员」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dIn any case, all we can do now is watch how this\nunfolds.\d%K%P
「不管怎样，事到如今我们也只能观望了」%K%P
