%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
...I finally said it.%K%P
…终于，说出来了。%K%P
I had forgotten how I'd started, or what I even wanted to\nsay.%K%P
她究竟理解了多少呢，\n我的想法究竟传达了多少呢。%K%P
Uttering that single phrase returned my mind to a blank\nstate.%K%P
我自己说出的，这句饱含着觉悟的话，\n让我几乎忘却了自己到现在为止的积累。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut I couldn't tell anyone -- what we were doing wouldn't\nreflect well on the boarding house. Or on you.\d%K%P
「但是，对谁也没有说出口呢。\n因为我们两个人做的事，对美都子来说…\n不，对这个公寓里的每一个人来说，都是无法被原谅的」%K%P
Everyone told me how vehemently Mitoko opposed all the\nadult relationships that plagued this house back when Ms.\nHonoka was still its landlord.%K%P
自从穗香小姐当上房东之后，\n美都子就对带入公寓内的男女关系表现出了过度的抗拒\n——大家是这样说的。%K%P
A mother who was too amiable for her own good... and\ncountless men who ended up infatuated by her gentle\ndemeanor.%K%P
对任何人，都过度温柔地对待的母亲。\n无法克制自己，情不自禁地去拥抱这份好意的大人们。%K%P
Perhaps it was no one's fault that things ended up this\nway. Still, Mitoko had been deeply hurt as a result.%K%P
大概谁也没有错。\n但是，大概谁都伤害了幼小的她的心，\n这一点也不难想象。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dKaya told me she'd be fine with keeping it a secret...\nand I used that as my excuse.\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐对我说，『不说出来也可以』。\n然后，我利用了这句话」%K%P
She said that the shadows suited her better, that being\nnumber two had always been her true calling... all the\nwhile smiling back at me.%K%P
『因为很适合背阴呢』也好『大概是二号（小三）体质吧』也好，\n都是她一边笑着一边对我说出来的。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTo me, it was an all too convenient \dlie.\d\d%K%P
「…因为这对我来说，是非常方便的“谎言”」%K%P
She wouldn't be able to just handle a behind-the-scenes\nlove affair like ours, especially after having lived a\nproper life for over twenty years.%K%P
二十年以上一直走着规规矩矩的道路的她，\n本来应该和这种『达观的境界』是无缘的。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI ended up trying to hide things from you again. I'm\nsorry.\d%K%P
「又有事瞒着你了。很抱歉」%K%P
But it was precisely that almost unnatural obsession with\nindulging others that attracted a coward like me to her.%K%P
但是，正是由于这种过于浓厚的甘甜，\n她身上才散发出让我这样的胆小鬼一下子就能上瘾的魅力。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dInstead of fulfilling our promise, I ended up betraying\nyou over and over again. And for that, I sincerely\napologize.\d%K%P
「一直没有能够完成和美都子的约定，\n只是一直辜负背叛着你，真是抱歉」%K%P
\dI'll become a worthy guardian for you, Mitoko.\d%K%P
『要成为美都子合格的监护人』%K%P
Yet with each step forward came another two backwards.\nAfter even the smallest of defeats, I would find a way to\nflee and lick my wounds.%K%P
在达成这个目标的道路上我已经栽了两次跟头，\n每一次，我都逃避到了那个用全身解数安慰我的人那里。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI realize that no words will be able to justify what I\ndid. But I'm still deeply sorry.\d%K%P
「就算我道歉大概也不会得到原谅，\n尽管如此，还是非常抱歉」%K%P
Even though I knew it would only end up hurting Mitoko, I\nwas unable to stave off those alluring temptations.%K%P
我知道这对于美都子来说很难忍受，\n但是，我却始终身陷这舒畅的心情难以自拔。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
My eyes grew accustomed enough to the dark for me to make\nout Mitoko's shape -- she was staring at me from a low\nangle, her chin resting on her knees.%K%P
习惯了黑暗的我的眼睛，\n捕捉到了把脸放在双膝上、眼珠朝上瞄着这边看的美都子的样子。%K%P
However, I still couldn't make out her expression.%K%P
但是，只能隐隐约约看清她的轮廓，\n她的眼神、面颊的热度、表情之类的完全无法感觉到。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's all I have to say.\d%K%P
