All that remained was to wait for her decision.%K%P
之后，就是等待美都子的决定。%K%P
Regardless of whether or not she forgave me -- I would\nobey her will.%K%P
不管她是否会原谅我，\n我都会，尊重她的决定。%K%P
Whether it be doubling my rent, making me clean the toilet\nfor a month, or having to carry her bags for a year... I\nwanted it to be something akin to an educational sort of\npunishment.%K%P
房租双倍也好、扫厕所一个月也好、拎行李一年也好…\n我祈祷着这种有着改正可能性的『教育性指导』。%K%P
As long as it wasn't the end of our friendship -- or my\nposition as her guardian.%K%P
我只希望…与作为朋友的我的“断绝交往”，\n或者与作为监护人的我的“断绝关系”这种处罚不会有…%K%P
