Whenever Kaya tried to be pushy, her tendency to be overly\nconsiderate of others made her hesitate at the critical\nmoment. The same applied to whenever she tried to take a\nstep back.%K%P
推的时候，因为考虑着对方而踌躇；\n拉的时候，因为顾虑着自己而踌躇。%K%P
Regardless of the approach, she would always corner\nherself and soldier on alone, until...%K%P
