一尘不染的房间，\n回到了我狼狈地进来时的空旷的状态。%K%P
I spent half a year sleeping, waking up, getting changed,\neating, drinking, and partying with others in this room.%K%P
这半年里，我在这里起床、换衣服、偶尔吃饭，\n喝酒、和大家一起胡闹，还有，睡觉。%K%P
I could still remember those blissful times like they\nhappened yesterday.%K%P
这种不间断的热闹日子，\n现在依然在我的脑海中清晰地回放。%K%P
Would these feelings fade with time? Would there ever come\na time when I no longer felt a special connection to this\nplace?%K%P
